OL,3,GNEWSAPhotos of 'forgotten' war heroes
OL,4,Atracked down after plea
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotos of "forgotten" World War Two
OL,7,Fsoldiers buried at a cemetery in the
OL,8,FNetherlands have been found after an
OL,9,Fappeal on BBC Wales, but many are still
OL,10,Fmissing.
OL,12,FCampaigners in the historical town of
OL,13,FVenray in the south-east of the country
OL,14,Fhave adopted the graves of more than
OL,15,F600 British soldiers killed in the war.
OL,17,F"These men paid the highest price for
OL,18,Four freedom," said volunteer Theo
OL,19,FVervoort from Venray War Cemetery
OL,20,FAdoption Graves Foundation.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
